      "sequence_position": 1,
      "problem": "Let $R$ be a $8\\times 12$ matrix that has $8$ pivot columns. What is the dimension of the null space of $R?$",
      "worked_solution": "We know that $\\text{dim(Null}(R))$ is the number of non-pivot columns in $R.$ \n\nSince $R$ has $12$ columns and $8$ of them are pivots, then the number of non-pivot columns in $R$ is \n\n$$\n12-8=4.\n$$\n\nTherefore, $\\text{dim(Null}(R))=4.$",
